      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ah, Ser Arisen!\r\nBy the way, I have good news.",
        "Jp" : "あっ、覚者さん！\r\nそういえば良いニュースがあるんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 400898,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I heard that the sub-crystals in Breya are now\r\navailable, all of them!",
        "Jp" : "ブリアにある《辺境の礎》ってやつが\r\n全部使えるようになったらしいよ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 476912,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I'm not really sure how to use that thing, but\r\nthey say you can use every single portcrystal in\r\nBreya— even the ones the Arisen has\r\nnever touched before.",
        "Jp" : "俺はアレの使い方、いまいちわかってないんだけど"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 476913,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The people at Temple arranged it because Arisen\r\noften come to Breya.\r\nThey said they can go to places that have been\r\nhard to get to in an instant.",
        "Jp" : "何でも、覚者さんが今までに触ったことのない礎も"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 478432,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Keep up the good work with Breya and Rotes, which\r\nis now easier to explore!",
        "Jp" : "このブリア内にある分は全部使えるんだってさ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 478433,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 1205,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "O'Neill",
      "Jp" : "オニール"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 16450,
    "GroupType" : 41,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_CRAFT_BLOCK",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Oh yeah, I've got a request for you, Arisen.\r\nYou know that old well near\r\nGrandpa Rudolfo's house.\r\nSome people say they saw something\r\nshiny at the back of it.",
        "Jp" : "そうそう、覚者さんにお願いしたいことがあってさ\r\nルドルフォ爺さんの家の近くに古い井戸があるだろ\r\nその奥に光るものを見たって人がいるんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 400899,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Maybe, just maybe there is a treasure at the\r\nbottom of the well..!\r\nTreasure can be found in such a humble place",
        "Jp" : "もしかして、もしかしたらだよ\r\n井戸の底にお宝が眠ってたりしたら――！\r\nお宝って意外とああいう地味なところに\r\nありそうだしさ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 476943,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So, I'd like you to come take a look\r\ninside if you'd like.\r\nGive me a shout before you go.\r\nThe blue light at the bottom of the well,\r\nit's curious, isn't it?",
        "Jp" : "ってわけで、よかったら中を見てきて欲しいんだ\r\n行く前には一声かけてくれ\r\n井戸底に沈む青い光、気になるじゃないか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 476944,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 1205,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "O'Neill",
      "Jp" : "オニール"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 16451,
    "GroupType" : 41,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_CRAFT_BLOCK",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Arisen, I had you take a look at it the other\r\nday; It's an \"old well under a lighthouse\", You\r\nsee the sealed door at the back?",
        "Jp" : "覚者さん、この前も見てきてもらった\r\n《灯台下の古井戸》なんだけどさ\r\n奥に封鎖された扉があっただろ？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 476957,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "That's supposed to be a door that leads to an old\r\nruin but by the time I became Area Master it was\r\nalready sealed up and no one knows what's\r\ngoing on in the back.",
        "Jp" : "あれは古い遺跡に繋がる扉らしいんだけど\r\n俺がエリアマスターになった時には\r\n既に封鎖されててね\r\n奥がどうなってるかは誰も知らないんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 476958,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "But I didn't want to keep the blockade up\r\nforever, so I took the plunge and unblocked it,\r\nsince I've had a lot of Arisen people stop by now.",
        "Jp" : "でも、ずっと封鎖したままっていうのもなんだし\r\n今は覚者さんもよく寄ってくれるから\r\n思い切って封鎖を解いてみたんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 476959,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The ocean is a man's romance, but there's\r\nsomething tantalizing about a site that's been\r\nsealed off, too isn't there?",
        "Jp" : "海は男のロマンだけど\r\n封鎖されていた遺跡っていうのも\r\n何というかくすぐられるものがあるだろ？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 476960,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 1205,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "O'Neill",
      "Jp" : "オニール"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 16452,
    "GroupType" : 41,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_CRAFT_BLOCK",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Arisen, let's talk in secret for a moment...",
        "Jp" : "覚者さん、ちょっと内密に話が――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 400901,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
