      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 13,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "No, no, I'm not talking about the kind of story\r\nthat needs to be hidden.\r\nThe Moltova Ruins, which we broke the blockade on\r\nthe other day— I'm going to go out\r\nthere, and it seems...",
        "Jp" : "い、いや、隠さなきゃいけないような\r\n話じゃないんだけどさ\r\nこの前封鎖を解いた《モルトバ遺跡》――\r\n出る、らしくって――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 476961,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "What's coming out, of course, is that thing!\r\nA dragon!　A water dragon.",
        "Jp" : "何が出るって、そりゃもちろんアレだよ！\r\n竜だよ！　水竜ってやつさ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 476962,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 15,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I thought because the Arisen is here I've broken\r\nthe blockade, but I don't want the dragon inside\r\nto get out of control.",
        "Jp" : "覚者さんが居るからと思って\r\n封鎖は解いたけど\r\n中の竜に暴れられるのは困るんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 476963,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 16,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Could you go see if there's any sign of them\r\ncoming outside I'd appreciate it if you'd give me\r\na shout before you leave.",
        "Jp" : "外に出てくる気配が無いか見てきてもらえないかな\r\n出発前に声かけてくれると助かるよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 476964,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
