      "GmdIndex" : 19,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Now it's thanks to you, Arisen,\r\nthat there is Breya!\r\nI'll rely on you from now on too!",
        "Jp" : "今や覚者さんあってのブリアだからさ！\r\n今後ともよろしく頼むよ！"
