      "GmdIndex" : 54,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "On the way there, we came across the remains of a\r\ncamp\r\nand before we knew it, a hobgoblin had settled\r\nthere.\r\nIt's a big guy.\r\nHe's big, and if he comes towards the village,\r\nit's going to be a big problem!",
        "Jp" : "そこへ行く途中のキャンプ跡に\r\nいつの間にかホブゴブリンが居付いちゃった\r\nようなんだ\r\n体格も大きいし、村の方に来たら大変だ！"
