      "GmdIndex" : 58,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "As it turns out, it's the [Tidal Caverns\r\nCave] near LeFlore--",
        "Jp" : "結論から言うと、それは\r\nルフロー近くにある《潮騒洞窟》――"
