      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 62,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "—What?\r\nNo, I'm not particularly scared of anything— I\r\nmean, I'm not scared at all!",
        "Jp" : "――え！？\r\nいや、俺は特になにも――\r\nっていうか全然怖がってないけど！"
