      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 65,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The only thing that's clear is that it was\r\ndestroyed overnight.\r\nWas it a big wave or did the monsters get it?\r\nThe real story is a mystery.\r\nWe still don't know what happened to the\r\ntreasure, either.",
        "Jp" : "一夜で滅んだことだけははっきりしてるけど\r\n大波が来たのか、魔物にやられたのか\r\n本当のところは謎なんだ\r\n財宝の件もまだ分からないんだけどさ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 255997,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 66,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So, near that Leflor, a traveler who stopped by\r\nthe inn yesterday said he saw a figure wandering\r\naround, muttering something—.",
        "Jp" : "で、そのルフロー付近で、何か呟きながら\r\n彷徨う人影を見たって\r\n昨日宿に寄った旅人が言ってたんだよ――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 255998,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 67,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "-Is this, perhaps, a ghost...?\r\nHey, Arisen, I'm sure you're curious too, right?\r\nSo, come on. Please go and check it out.",
        "Jp" : "――これって、もしかして幽霊――？\r\nほら覚者さんも気になるだろ？\r\nだからさ、ほら。確かめてきてくれよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 255999,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
